<title>USA: TABLE-Guidant Corp Q2 oper net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Guidant Corp Q2 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper Shr			  $0.63		    $0.53</p>
<p> Oper Net			 45,400		   37,900</p>
<p> Revs			    281,000		  265,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs			 72,300		   72,050</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>			     6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper Shr			  $1.23		    $0.92</p>
<p> Oper Net			 88,600		   66,400</p>
<p> Revs			    546,500		  517,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs			 72,230		   72,020</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Results exclude impact of $57.4-million pretax purchased R&amp;D charge recorded in 1997 Q2 on acquisition of NeoCardia LLC, as well as $28.8 million in noncash special obsolescence charges related to older cardiac rhythm management products and programmers and $66.9 million in noncash impaired asset charges announced in May 1996 related to atherectomy business.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
